Gathers succeeded, failed, skipped, and cancelled node tuples from _results and _scheduler states') synthesize NodeResult(SKIPPED)/(CANCELLED) entries from scheduler states so results covers every node and total_nodes matches the key set. Fix all four in the implementation; the test suite faithfully encodes the low/*.pyi contracts.
